{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52914","headline":"秀华亭 · 李白","name":"秀华亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遥望九华峰，诚然是九华。\n苍颜耐风雪，奇态灿云霞。\n曜日凝成锦，凌霄增壁崖。\n何当余荫照，天造洞仙家。\n（见《青阳县志·艺文志》及《九华山志》卷八）（〖1〗《李白在安徽》云：秀华亭在九华山麓，五溪桥侧，延寿寺前。\n亭已圮，遗址犹存。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}